  "steps": [
   "Heat the oven to 200°C (180°C fan). Rub the chicken with half the oil and half the salt, push a lemon half inside and roast in a large tray for 30 minutes.",
   "Toss the potatoes in the remaining oil and tuck them around the chicken. Roast for 50 minutes more, until golden and the chicken juices run clear. Rest for 10 minutes.",
   "Meanwhile, mix the yoghurt, garlic, juice of the other lemon half and half the herbs. Toss the cucumber, radishes and spring onions with the remaining salt.",
   "Tear the lettuce onto a platter and add the cucumber and potatoes. Pull the chicken into pieces, scatter it over and spoon on the tray juices.",
   "Drizzle with the dressing and finish with the remaining herbs and plenty of black pepper."
